{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 21, "data": [{"docid2": 1885100, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202303/t20230307_1885100.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据\n　　为深入贯彻落实党中央、国务院关于实施健康中国战略的决策部署，根据《国务院办公厅关于印发“十四五”国民健康规划的通知》（国办发〔2022〕11号）精神，在落实《福建省“十四五”卫生健康发", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202303/t20230307_1885100.htm", "docreltime": "2023.03.07 10:08:00", "doctitle": "《三明市贯彻落实“十四五” 国民健康规划实施方案》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2035109, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202303/t20230307_1885100.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202303/", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1885015, "docid2": 1885100, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202303/t20230307_1885100.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2023-03-07 10:08:00", "srcdoctitle": "《三明市贯彻落实“十四五” 国民健康规划实施方案》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/fpjyylshbzcjjydfmdzccsjqssqk/202303/t20230307_1885015.htm", "tardocreltime": "2023-03-07 08:32:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市贯彻落实“十四五”国民健康规划实施方案的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1846719, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202211/t20221115_1846719.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，市政府办公室印发《三明市“十四五”深化医药卫生体制改革专项规划》（明政办〔2022〕45号），现将主要内容解读如下：\n　　一、编制背景\n　　“十三五”时期，全市深入贯彻落实习近平总书记关于深化医改工", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202211/t20221115_1846719.htm", "docreltime": "2022.11.15 17:20:00", "doctitle": "关于《三明市“十四五”深化医药卫生体制改革专项规划》的政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1982635, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202211/t20221115_1846719.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202211/t20221115_1846711.htm", "appdocid": 1846719, "appfile": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202211/t20221115_1846711.htm", "appflag": 40, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202211/t20221115_1846719.htm", "fileext": "", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202211/http://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202211/t20221115_1846711.htm"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202211/", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1846711, "docid2": 1846719, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202211/t20221115_1846719.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2022-11-15 17:20:00", "srcdoctitle": "关于《三明市“十四五”深化医药卫生体制改革专项规划》的政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202211/t20221115_1846711.htm", "tardocreltime": "2022-11-15 17:16:00", "tardoctitle": "关于印发三明市“十四五”深化医药卫生体制改革专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1837509, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202210/t20221014_1837509.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，三明市人民政府出台《三明市加快生物医药产业高质量发展行动计划（2022-2025年）》(以下简称《行动计划》）。现对政策出台背景、主要内容、保障措施等相关情况进行解读。\n　　一、出台背景\n　　生物医药产", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202210/t20221014_1837509.htm", "docreltime": "2022.10.14 11:00:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市加快生物医药产业高质量发展行动计划（2022-2025年）》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1982622, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202210/t20221014_1837509.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "《三明市加快生物医药产业高质量发展行动计划（2022-2025年）》政策解读.jpg", "ap