"srcdoctitle": "《三明市“十四五”生态文明建设专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202210/t20221031_1842736.htm", "tardocreltime": "2022-10-11 23:02:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府关于印发三明市“十四五”生态文明建设专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1815285, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202208/t20220805_1815285.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据\n　　“十四五”时期，数字经济的作用和地位将继续提升，是今后经济增长的重要源泉，是提高全要素生产率的重要途径，是促进制造业服务业融合发展的重要载体，也是维护和提升产业分工体系稳定性安全", "docabstract": "数字三明建设", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202208/t20220805_1815285.htm", "docreltime": "2022.08.05 11:19:00", "doctitle": "三明市“十四五”数字三明建设专项规划政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1945620, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202208/t20220805_1815285.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202208/", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1815248, "docid2": 1815285, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202208/t20220805_1815285.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2022-08-05 11:19:00", "srcdoctitle": "三明市“十四五”数字三明建设专项规划政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202208/t20220805_1815248.htm", "tardocreltime": "2022-08-05 10:58:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”数字三明建设专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1785141, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.fjmx.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/zfxxgkml/fggzhgf/gfxwj/202205/t20220510_1785141.htm", "content": "\n\n\n各乡（镇）人民政府，县直有关部门：\n　　现将《明溪县“十四五”中医药发展专项规划》印发给你们，请认真贯彻实施。\n　　明溪县人民政府\n　　2022年4月27日\n　　 \n　　 \n明溪县“十四五”中医药发展专项规划\n", "docabstract": "明溪县“十四五”中医药发展专项规划", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.fjmx.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/zfxxgkml/fggzhgf/gfxwj/202205/t20220510_1785141.htm", "docr