4740.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2022-04-07 10:30:00", "srcdoctitle": "关于《宁化县“十四五”综合交通运输发展专项规划》解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "http://www.fjnh.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/zfxxgkml/spypaq_1/202203/t20220315_1766226.htm", "tardocreltime": "2022-03-15 20:28:00", "tardoctitle": "宁化县人民政府办公室关于印发《宁化县“十四五”特色现代农业发展专项规划》的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1749602, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/t20220114_1749602.htm", "content": "\n　　一、编制背景\n　　“十四五”时期是我国全面建成小康社会、实现第一个百年奋斗目标之后，乘势而上开启全面建设社会主义现代化国家新征程、向第二个百年奋斗目标进军的第一个五年；是三明建设“一区六城”、奋力", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020220126624117037865.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/t20220114_1749602.htm", "docreltime": "2022.01.14 14:43:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”残疾人保障和发展规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1869981, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/t20220114_1749602.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "20220126172147.jpg", "appdocid": 1749602, "appfile": "W020220126624016763078.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/t20220114_1749602.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202201/W020220126/W020220126624016763078.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/W020220126624016763078.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/W020220126624016763078.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1749596, "docid2": 1749602, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202201/t20220114_1749602.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2022-01-14 14:43:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”残疾人保障和发展规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202201/t20220114_1749596.htm", "tardocreltime": "