, "docid2": 1732394, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732394.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-11-30 10:14:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”教育发展专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202111/t20211130_1732331.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-11-30 08:33:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”教育发展专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1732390, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732390.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据\n　　“十四五”时期，紧紧围绕举旗帜、聚民心、育新人、兴文化、展形象的使命任务，加强社会主义精神文明建设，繁荣发展文化事业、文化产业和旅游业。围绕“牢记新嘱托、增创新优势、再上新台阶”", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020211210596262549498.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732390.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.30 09:34:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”文化和旅游改革发展专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1852514, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732390.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "20211210163019.jpg", "appdocid": 1732390, "appfile": "W020211210596075955200.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732390.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202112/W020211210/W020211210596075955200.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211210596075955200.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211210596075955200.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1732323, "docid2": 1732390, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732390.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-11-30 09:34:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”文化和旅游改革发展专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202111/t20211130_1732323.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-11-30 08:25:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”文化和旅游改革发展专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1732375, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732375.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据   \n　　“十四五”时期是我国全面建成小康社会、实现第一个百年奋斗目标之后，乘势而上开启全面建设社会主义现代化国家新征程、向第二个百年奋斗目标进军的第一个五年。以习近平新时代中国特色社会", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020211217622267311064.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732375.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.30 09:31:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”人力资源和社会保障事业发展专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1855724, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732375.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "20211217171736.jpg", "appdocid": 1732375, "appfile": "W020211217622153682271.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732375.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202112/W020211217/W020211217622153682271.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211217622153682271.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211217622153682271.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1732318, "docid2": 1732375, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211130_1732375.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-11-30 09:31:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”人力资源和社会保障事业发展专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202111/t20211130_1732318.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-11-30 08:19:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”人力资源和社会保障事业发展专项规划的通知"}]}, {"doc