　根据三明市人民政府的部署要求，在紧密衔接", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/sswgh/sswjd/202111/t20211123_1729758.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.23 10:32:00", "doctitle": "《三明市“十四五”林业发展专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1843899, "sourcename": "市林业局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/sswgh/sswjd/202111/t20211123_1729758.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/sswgh/sswjd/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1725982, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据\n　　“十四五”时期是我国开启全面建设社会主义现代化国家新征程、向第二个百年奋斗目标进军、加快建设交通强国的第一个五年，是综合交通运输服务水平提高和转型发展的关键期。习近平总书记作出重", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020211122403581123535.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.10 17:34:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”现代综合交通运输体系专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1849983, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "20211122111139.jpg", "appdocid": 1725982, "appfile": "W020211122402349813790.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202111/W020211122/W020211122402349813790.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211122402349813790.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/W020211122402349813790.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1725961, "docid2": 1725982, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202111/t20211110_1725982.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-11-10 17:34:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”现代综合交通运输体系专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202111/t20211110_1725961.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-11-10 17:18:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”现代综合交通运输体系专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1713197, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/t20211009_1713197.htm", "content": "\n　　一、背景依据\n　　民政工作关系民生、连着民心，是社会建设的兜底性、基础性工作。科学研究和编制好《规划》是贯彻落实党的十九届五中全会、省委十届十一次全会精神、市委九届十四次全会的重要任务，是谋划我市", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020211109556490450490.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/t20211009_1713197.htm", "docreltime": "2021.10.09 11:23:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”民政事业发展专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1832819, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/t20211009_1713197.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "20211109153011.jpg", "appdocid": 1713197, "appfile": "W020211109556340806825.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/t20211009_1713197.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202111/W020211109/W020211109556340806825.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/W020211109556340806825.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/W020211109556340806825.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1713181, "docid2": 1713197, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202110/t20211009_1713197.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-10-09 11:23:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”民政事业发展专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202110/t20211009_1713181.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-10-09 11:05:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”民政事业发展专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1708063, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，三明市人民政府办公室出台《三明市“十四五”开发区发展专项规划》。现对《规划》起草背景、基本特点、主要内容等相关情况进行解读。\n　　一、起草背景\n　　开发区是区域经济发展的重要增长极，是培育产业", "docabstract": "政策解读", "doclogo": "P020210930624888309204.png", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "docreltime": "2021.09.22 11:05:00", "doctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”开发区发展专项规划》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1832818, "sourcename": "市政府办", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "2021093045.jpg", "appdocid": 1708063, "appfile": "W020210930624506169608.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202109/W020210930/W020210930624506169608.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/W020210930624506169608.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/W020210930624506169608.jpg", "rels": [{"reldocid": 1708033, "docid2": 1708063, "sern": 1, "srcdocpeople": "", "srcdocpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zcjd/bszcjd/202109/t20210922_1708063.htm", "srcdocreltime": "2021-09-22 11:05:00", "srcdoctitle": "图解：《三明市“十四五”开发区发展专项规划》政策解读", "tardocpeople": "", "tardocpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/smsrmzfbgs/smsrmzf/zfxxgkml/ghjh/202109/t20210922_1708033.htm", "tardocreltime": "2021-09-22 10:45:00", "tardoctitle": "三明市人民政府办公室关于印发三明市“十四五”开发区发展专项规划的通知"}]}, {"docid2": 1705641, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "“十四五”解读", "chnldocurl": "http://ww